Package: LinkEDA
Title: Native Interactive Statistical Graphics and Analyses
Version: 0.0.120
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Valero-Mora", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "valerop@uv.es")
Author: Pedro Valero-Mora [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pedro Valero-Mora <valerop@uv.es>
Description: A native desktop environment for exploratory data analysis and
    statistical modelling from R. It provides linked statistical graphics,
    editable data sheets, shared selections and analysis scopes, model
    diagnostics, multiple-imputation analyses, publication exports, and
    executable R verification recipes.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: macOS with clang and Cocoa/AppKit frameworks; Windows 11
    with Rtools for the TCP backend, and Visual Studio with the Windows App SDK
    for the optional native WinUI desktop application.
